            "title": "What touches the milk is glass and silicone, not ordinary polypropylene",
            "body": "<p>This is the main difference careful parents are looking for. Hosfu uses a borosilicate glass body for the milk chamber and a soft silicone nipple for feeding, so the parts parents think about most are made from materials chosen for warm-feeding routines.</p><p>Parents do not need to memorise material science. They just need a bottle that makes the better material choice obvious.</p>",
            "image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0979/5082/6776/files/7_42abcc33-e818-48bf-9a2c-543dc68eb5a2.png?v=1783484878",
