        "reason-8": {
          "type": "reason",
          "settings": {
            "number": "8",
            "title": "Built so your baby can actually use it, not just so it sounds safer",
            "body": "<p>A bottle only works if the baby accepts it. That is why the nipple feel, flow comfort, grip and cleaning experience matter. Hosfu is positioned as a practical daily bottle: soft silicone latch, clear glass milk chamber, easy cleaning and a premium feel parents can trust during tired 3am feeds.</p><p>The goal is simple: a safer-feeling material choice without making feeding feel complicated.</p>",
            "image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0979/5082/6776/files/8.png?v=1783484878",
            "image_alt": "Baby feeding with soft silicone nipple bottle"
          }
