        "reason-9": {
          "type": "reason",
          "settings": {
            "number": "9",
            "title": "The honest part: it is not the cheapest option",
            "body": "<p>Cheap plastic is cheap for a reason. Borosilicate glass, silicone and better heat-resistant materials cost more — and that is the point. Hosfu is for parents who would rather buy based on material quality than keep replacing cloudy, scratched or questionable bottles.</p><p>No bottle can remove every worry from early parenthood. But choosing what touches your baby’s milk is one decision you can make deliberately.</p>",
            "image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0979/5082/6776/files/9.png?v=1783484878",
            "image_alt": "Premium Hosfu bottle setup and packaging"
